{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:111e4570369a715c11a1b38c69c11731cd22401df33cc4303f17fcd0c5d89f19",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb257ee79a77ffeeef927d5227485dafbfb6cb8a9ab634abdeadd53dca59cd48",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4056b8e9817c155bf3a89e32351c8bc664bbc5b58fbeb43ea3398611edf72513",
      "text": "和那些成员一起工作，\n开心到完全不觉得是第一次呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d0595511898acc29586cd8929d3d9e4f2013a6b0213f1e1ff8c0ca66be7f98d",
      "text": "一直想尝试的舞台编排，\n也得到了大家的协助得以实现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:058a4cab16beb17e832bda0c67226b1e9bab393c0745004c57ce0e5d09591b4a",
      "text": "以前在电视上看到其他偶像做过，\n就想着什么时候我也能尝试一次就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:614a4f99fed050bf12c9ce4b8d65148efb2d0e246f83a173ec5e0bcbd53d3397",
      "text": "制作人也是，再次向你道谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58ee2a34f5fb0929317325565902675d4a358b64a8d217de563caf51198ed205",
      "text": "你曾对我说过，正因为是经典套路，粉丝和观看的人\n才会更喜欢对吧。听到那些我很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd44a04881d25c48efdb183ae80cb8ad653acd12c9a1e98025dfd6b9529170d1",
      "text": "他们绝对会\n喜欢的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4584443ba2d333940b074d8f45645a304d70461943ffd1bbde16d29341092734",
      "text": "我现在也是\n这么认为的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffae36f3fca5052e1283fa1227afb7f6e3492fb05c0b6884e2711308962cd53b",
      "text": "嗯，我也这么觉得。\n所以，非常迫不及待地想等到上线的那一天呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_305_2_3_011_05_09_a:2_3_011_05_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:038f9b6e72753ee55fd23c476f5a2133e8e6eff2e2a8155d45eea1caa11a7f6a",
      "text": "接下来委托剪辑之类的各种事情都很辛苦，\n拜托你了。那么，我期待着制作完成的联络。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
